# rule.ath: the counts in RULE.md, as integer claims. Trivial by design: asteroid parses integer equalities only.
# One lead, four helpers: 1 lead, 4 helpers, 5 agents per round.
claim 1 = 1
claim 4 = 4
claim 5 = 5
# Write the rule into the memory record the bus reads (the double-way memory: OUT here, IN from the bus).
record workshop/orchestra rule open "One lead and four helpers per round (workshop/orchestra/RULE.md). The lead is one Opus agent; each helper is one Haiku agent with one input and one output; helpers do not spawn helpers. Counts checked in rule.ath (3 true). The reason for four is a default, not an optimum."
